@startuml F3.4-D04-encaminhar-professor
title F3.4-D04 — Encaminhar para outro professor
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "RequestController" as Ctrl
participant "ForwardRequestUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Prof -> WebApp: Confirmar encaminhamento
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /requests/{id}/transitions\n{ action: FORWARD }
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: UPDATE deliberante\n+ request_event\n+ JTI deep-link\n+ outbox_event
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> Ctrl: ok
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Prof: timeline ENCAMINHADA

@enduml
